version: 2.0.0
description: Utility command namespace — groups beacon, constellation, echo, sync-llms, thread, and probe under `paradigm util`
components:
  util-namespace:
    description: 'registerUtilCommands() attaches a `util` subcommand group to the root Commander program with 6 nested subcommands: beacon, constellation, echo, sync-llms, thread, probe. Action handlers delegate to the original command modules.'
    type: command-group
    tags:
      - feature
      - util
